.TH CRUNCH_EXIT_GROUP 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_exit_group \- Linux x86-64 syscall 231
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B void noreturn crunch_exit_group(int status);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminates all threads in the process without running finalizers.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Does not return.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR exit_group (2)
